# Environments and caches
.venv/
venv/
__pycache__/
*.pyc
*.pyo
.ipynb_checkpoints/
.mypy_cache/
.pytest_cache/
.ruff_cache/

# System cruft
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
*:Zone.Identifier

# Never version pipeline/agent traces
.sciflow/
.claude/
CLAUDE.md

# NOTE. The usual public template also ignores `env/` and `*.log`. Both rules are
# deliberately absent here. `experiments/<id>/env/` holds the environment
# snapshots (requirements.txt, system_info.json) that make a run reproducible,
# and `results/*.log` is recorded run output, not build noise. Ignoring either
# would silently drop evidence.
